    "description": "<p>This Charm permanently enhances its prerequisite, allowing the Lunar to pay a three-mote surcharge to store Elsewhere objects (per the Charm Concept box on p. 213 of Exalted) that are too large to be lifted with one hand. This causes the Charm's invocation time to change from Speed 5 to five long ticks, though retrieving an object is as fast as normal. More than one Wyld Hunt has retreated in sudden disarray when an apparently unarmed Steward threw aside his cloak to reveal a light implosion bow.</p>",
